# ==============================================================================
# SECTION 1: WORKING & PRESERVED FILES (Explicit Whitelists)
# ==============================================================================
# Whitelist active project sources, configuration definitions, and docs.
!src/
!assets/
!cloudflare/
!tools/
!docs/
!src/models/
!index.html
!renying-offline.html
!renying.html
!readme*.md
!license
!.gitignore
!.github/

# ==============================================================================
# SECTION 2: HIDDEN & IGNORED ARTIFACTS
# ==============================================================================

